[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9001.27, "timestamp": "02:30:01", "text": "事件。我不怪你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9003.349, "timestamp": "02:30:03", "text": "意思是说你不怪他们？你知道吗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9005.75, "timestamp": "02:30:05", "text": "他们做了什么？任何。我知道。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9007.75, "timestamp": "02:30:07", "text": "他们本该做的，是他们自己的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9009.51, "timestamp": "02:30:09", "text": "事物。他们所做的就是把它放上去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9010.87, "timestamp": "02:30:10", "text": "社交媒体供所有人发表意见，这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9013.11, "timestamp": "02:30:13", "text": "我认为这是错误的。我讨厌这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9015.11, "timestamp": "02:30:15", "text": "人们试图展现出来的东西。我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9016.87, "timestamp": "02:30:16", "text": "这是她犯下的最严重的错误。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9019.429, "timestamp": "02:30:19", "text": "她做的事，没错，都怪我吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9021.59, "timestamp": "02:30:21", "text": "但我见过更糟糕的。我已经 我已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9023.349, "timestamp": "02:30:23", "text": "在成长过程中，我们经历了这样一代人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9024.79, "timestamp": "02:30:24", "text": "Tumblr 以及所有的一切，并且知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9026.23, "timestamp": "02:30:26", "text": "关于所有这些动漫展和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9028.469, "timestamp": "02:30:28", "text": "在虚拟动漫展上举办的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9031.91, "timestamp": "02:30:31", "text": "日本的情况比我们糟糕得多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9034.55, "timestamp": "02:30:34", "text": "2023年跷跷板。Gojo没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9037.11, "timestamp": "02:30:37", "text": "因为他不是，但我见过爆豪胜己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9046.15, "timestamp": "02:30:46", "text": "同一件事。呃，和五条悟一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9050.15, "timestamp": "02:30:50", "text": "他其实还是个未成年人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9052.23, "timestamp": "02:30:52", "text": "真恶心，我不知道为什么有人会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9054.309, "timestamp": "02:30:54", "text": "你知道我的意思，我可以，我可以你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9056.95, "timestamp": "02:30:56", "text": "我知道我尽力了，但我并不喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9058.55, "timestamp": "02:30:58", "text": "我知道我为什么试图为那件事辩解。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9059.75, "timestamp": "02:30:59", "text": "我心想，你们都看着呢。"}]